# Everything under vendor/ is somebody else's data, held locally so the
# series in data/ can be rebuilt, and never committed.
#   vendor/equity_exports/    investing.com price and dividend history
#   vendor/freight_captures/  TradingView, investing.com, barchart
#   vendor/sec_filings/       SEC EDGAR 6-K exhibits
# Provenance and a SHA-256 for every derived series live in the
# _manifest.json beside it under data/.
vendor/

# Power BI project: the local data cache and per-user settings are
# rebuilt on open and never committed. The model definition (TMDL) is.
**/.pbi/cache.abf
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
